# Trading disclaimer

- All user-facing output (API responses, UI, exports) must include a clear **not financial advice** disclaimer.
- Use the single source constant (e.g. `DISCLAIMER` in `app/api/routes.py`) and reference it from all surfaces.
- No guarantees about outcomes; educational and research only.
